==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Electabuzz|46}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion; both cards have the Head Bolt attack.
*'''Head Bolt''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Manectric|44}} from the {{TCG|Platinum: Arceus|Arceus}} expansion. 
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

